# Phase 5 QUESTION-CTRL-J: C-j at a model question that arrives while
# `/status` is open. fx v0.0.16's question takes every raw byte before any
# menu does (`routeActiveModalInput`, app_input_runtime.zig:1136-1160@481104fd,
# ahead of the MCP menu and the compact menus at :1186-1216, whose C-j is the
# next row, :1205; the picker's C-j yields to it, :1110-1116), so C-j answers
# the question, `Thorough`, and the panel comes back as it was.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway p5-question-ctrl-j-panel-turns.json
wait 4
type ask me
key Enter
wait 0.8
type /status
key Enter
wait 0.8
snap open-before-question
wait 3
snap question-arrives
key -H 0a
wait 1.5
snap question-ctrl-j
wait 1
snap end
gwlog
